WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.026 --> 00:00:05.322
Sam was in trouble!

2
00:00:05.323 --> 00:00:09.830
Cora looked at Mo and Lenny.

3
00:00:09.831 --> 00:00:15.278
"Wait here," she whispered.

4
00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:20.038
Cora made herself very flat.

5
00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:23.585
She shot across the ocean floor.

6
00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:25.830
Then she looked up.

7
00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:29.098
Seaweed was everywhere.

8
00:00:29.099 --> 00:00:35.362
"Where's Sam?" Cora thought.

9
00:00:35.363 --> 00:00:43.764
The arrow led Cora up.

10
00:00:43.765 --> 00:00:50.598
She swam to the clump of leaves.

11
00:00:50.599 --> 00:00:54.600
Barracudas swam all around.

12
00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:58.529
Cora slowly stretched her arm up high.

13
00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.783
She felt Sam!

14
00:01:01.784 --> 00:01:09.967
Cora used a sucker to pull him down. Shloop!

15
00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:14.642
Then Cora sprayed her dark ink.

16
00:01:14.643 --> 00:01:19.604
"I can't see anything!" a barracuda said.

17
00:01:19.605 --> 00:01:26.901
Cora and Sam escaped. Whoosh!

18
00:01:26.902 --> 00:01:33.008
Everyone went back to Rainbow Reef.

19
00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:37.010
"Thanks, Cora," Lenny said.

20
00:01:37.011 --> 00:01:42.228
Sam nodded. "I was trying to find Lenny.

21
00:01:42.229 --> 00:01:46.147
I didn't think you wanted to help me."

22
00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:50.004
Cora nodded. "I wanted to help you.

23
00:01:50.005 --> 00:01:53.105
But you two kept playing tricks."

24
00:01:53.106 --> 00:02:02.194
"We're sorry," the clownfish said.

25
00:02:02.195 --> 00:02:09.784
Later Sam hurried over. "I can't find Lenny!"

26
00:02:09.785 --> 00:02:14.455
Cora frowned. "Is this a trick?"

27
00:02:14.456 --> 00:02:22.644
Sam laughed. "No! We're playing hide-and-seek.

28
00:02:22.645 --> 00:02:25.747
Do you want to play with us?"

29
00:02:25.748 --> 00:02:31.931
Cora grinned. "You bet!"

